  "analysis_md": "$$\\frac{\\partial z}{\\partial x}=yf_1+2xf_2,$$\n\n$$\\frac{\\partial^2z}{\\partial x\\partial y}=f_1+xyf_{11}+2y^2f_{12}+4xyf_{22}=f_1+xyf_{11}+2(x^2+y^2)f_{12}+4xyf_{22}$$",
